 runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 34 years. In 2025, August to September ran 49% of normal on the middle of the grids, and July to August ran 70%. Every grid had its driest year in 1958, with grid 28984 the lowest at 65%.</p>"}
